# 019-options.lua

Plain data for the options tally (issue 106's `scripts/tally-options`):
returns a list of room-folders' undecided choices, each
`{ id, question, waits_on = "owner"|"state", detail, config_key, variants = { {name, summary, built_in, tests, findings}, ... }, leaning }`
(all strings except `variants`).  Load with `dofile`.

Choices: `rooms-unknown-parent` (key `rooms.unknown-parent`),
`rooms-slash-in-name` (key `rooms.slash-in-name`), `rooms-bell-failure`
(not switchable), `rooms-write-durability` (not switchable, waits on state).
